1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,656
Where does <b>your store data</b> go when you install this plugin?

2
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:07,412
Here's the whole install, in <b>one take</b>.

3
00:00:07,568 --> 00:00:11,339
Plugins, Add Plugin.

4
00:00:13,223 --> 00:00:14,221
Search.

5
00:00:18,837 --> 00:00:19,917
Install.

6
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,692
Activate.

7
00:00:26,352 --> 00:00:31,352
There's one prompt: an <b>optional</b> opt-in from Freemius, our licensing provider.

8
00:00:32,023 --> 00:00:32,764
We <b>skip it</b>.

9
00:00:32,814 --> 00:00:37,484
<b>No account. No API key.</b> No setup wizard.

10
00:00:38,321 --> 00:00:41,407
The dashboard is already reading the store's own orders —

11
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:46,963
and it's self-hosted: what it records stays in <b>your own WordPress database</b>.

12
00:00:47,436 --> 00:00:51,689
Now a shopper — <b>not logged in</b> — searches the store for <b>"hoodie"</b>,

13
00:00:51,945 --> 00:00:53,949
and opens two products.

14
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:03,128
Back in wp-admin: Customer History, Search Analytics.

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,483
There's <b>"hoodie"</b>.

16
00:01:07,083 --> 00:01:09,215
And there are the two products they opened.

17
00:01:10,436 --> 00:01:14,864
Your own admin browsing isn't recorded — <b>this came from the shopper</b>.

18
00:01:15,192 --> 00:01:17,952
Even the plugin's own usage counters stay here.

19
00:01:18,330 --> 00:01:20,784
Tools, Site Health, Info:

20
00:01:22,766 --> 00:01:25,161
"This information <b>stays on your server</b>."

21
00:01:26,492 --> 00:01:28,840
So here is <b>the decision</b> this gives you.

22
00:01:29,497 --> 00:01:34,609
Whether customer analytics has to mean sending your customer data to someone else's servers.

23
00:01:35,198 --> 00:01:39,808
With a plugin like this, it doesn't — no SaaS account, no API key,

24
00:01:40,149 --> 00:01:44,033
and the data sits in the <b>same database as your orders</b>.

25
00:01:44,632 --> 00:01:47,070
Everything you just saw is the <b>free version</b>.

26
00:01:47,649 --> 00:01:51,502
Free shows the last 90 days; Pro shows your full history.

27
00:01:51,988 --> 00:01:54,836
<b>Install it free</b> — the link is below.

